  OAuth consent URL when the current user can connect or update permissions.
  
  |Authentication Category    |Callable      |
  |:--------------------------|:-------------|
  | SESSION | ✅ Yes |
  | API_TOKEN | ✅ Yes |
  | CONTAINER_TOKEN | ❌ No |
  | FIRST_PARTY_OAUTH | ❌ No |
  | THIRD_PARTY_OAUTH | ❌ No |
  | UNAUTHENTICATED | ❌ No |
  """
  consentUrl: String
