  Jira issue assignability for this agent in the given Jira cloud.
  Pass cloudId for the Jira site to query (often the same value as agentStudio_getAgents.cloudId).
  Hydration uses this agent's Rovo agent ARI (`id`) with `jira_agentAssignabilityByAgentIds`, matching `jira_isAgentAssignable` `agentInput.agentId`.
  
