"""
Represent a group in admin hub.

Implements `AdminPrincipal` because a group can hold a role. A group is a collection rather
than an account, so it cannot authenticate, own a credential, or appear as the actor in an
audit trail, and it is never the value of a field that records who performed an action.
"""
