"Whether Rovo is available to this caller on this site, and whether an enabled Rovo widget with a live agent is configured for the requested help center container."
type AgentStudioUnlicensedRovoWidgetConfig @apiGroup(name : AGENT_STUDIO) {
  "The widget's agent id (a bare id, not an ARI). Non-null when the caller is Rovo-entitled, has widget access, and a widget with a live agent is configured for this container, including when that widget's enable toggle is off. Null in every other case."
  agentId: String
  "Site-level Rovo entitlement for JSM. True only when the caller is not a JSM portal customer account, the product is active, rovoLLMEnabled is set, the caller passes the generative-AI RBAC policy, and JSM is in aiEnabledProducts. Independent of whether a widget exists on this help center."
  isRovoEntitled: Boolean
  "The admin enable/disable toggle for this help center's widget. True only when isRovoEntitled is true, the caller has widget access (JSM portal role or Rovo product access), and an enabled widget with a live agent is configured for this container. False in every other case, including no widget configured, a deactivated agent, and insufficient access."
