"""
A single reason an agent was excluded from a recommended-agents response.
Modelled as `{ code, message }` so the FE can localise / theme off `code`
and the back-end can pass through a fallback `message` for codes the FE
doesn't yet know about (e.g. after a back-end-only roll-forward).
"""
