  Coverage gaps this agent is on the hook for in the time range. The FE
  renders these as a third category alongside `shifts` and `coveringShifts`.
  Each gap carries enough addressing information for the FE to invoke
  `agentWorkspace_assignAgentToGap` and
  `agentWorkspace_recommendedAgentsForCoverageGap` directly. Stubbed to an
  empty list until coverage-gap reads are implemented.
  """
  coverageGapDetails: [AgentWorkspaceCoverageGap!]
  """
  Covering shifts this agent has been assigned to in the time range, including
  covers on schedules they are not rostered to. Stubbed to an empty list until
  coverage-gap reads are implemented.
  """
  coveringShifts: [AgentWorkspaceCoveringShift!]!
  "Whether this agent has any shifts in the time range"
  hasShifts: Boolean!
  """
