  Total number of covering shifts in the time range, across all agents. A
  covering shift is a segment an agent has been assigned to cover for someone
  else; the FE renders these alongside rostered shifts under
  `AgentWorkspaceAgentShifts.coveringShifts`.
  """
  totalCoveredShifts: Int!
  """
  Total number of coverage gaps in the time range, across all agents. Each
  gap is a segment on a rostered agent's schedule that nobody is currently
  assigned to cover; the FE surfaces these under
  `AgentWorkspaceAgentShifts.coverageGaps` so the user can act on them.
