  """
  
  
  |Authentication Category    |Callable      |
  |:--------------------------|:-------------|
  | SESSION | ✅ Yes |
  | API_TOKEN | ✅ Yes |
  | CONTAINER_TOKEN | ❌ No |
  | FIRST_PARTY_OAUTH | ❌ No |
  | THIRD_PARTY_OAUTH | ❌ No |
  | UNAUTHENTICATED | ❌ No |
  """
  failureReason: String
  """
  Open-ended execution output keyed by well-known names such as `blockContent`.
  
