"""
An experience that tells an end customer contact (ECC) of a partner-managed account to contact their
partner for an action only the partner can perform. It is intended to be embedded and renders no close
controls; the host is responsible for dismissing it.
"""
type CcpContactPartnerExperienceCapability implements CommerceExperienceCapability @apiGroup(name : COMMERCE_CCP) {
  """
  The URL to access the experience.
  The client MUST add an `atlOrigin` query parameter to the URL as per
  https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/PGT/pages/197457957/How+to+use+Origin+Tracing#Journey-begins%3A-a-share%2Finvite-action-happens
  """
  experienceUrl: String
  """
  True when the current user is an end customer contact on the entitlement's invoice group and the
  transaction account is partner-managed, in which case the experience should be shown instead of the
  self-serve flow. False means the experience does not apply to the user.
  Null with an error means eligibility could not be determined and must not be treated as false.
  The experience itself does not check eligibility, so this field is the only gate.
  """
  isAvailableToUser: Boolean
}

