  | API_TOKEN | ❌ No |
  | CONTAINER_TOKEN | ❌ No |
  | FIRST_PARTY_OAUTH | ❌ No |
  | THIRD_PARTY_OAUTH | ❌ No |
  | UNAUTHENTICATED | ✅ Yes |
  """
  link: String
  """
  Raw Opsgenie priority string.
  
  |Authentication Category    |Callable      |
  |:--------------------------|:-------------|
  | SESSION | ✅ Yes |
  | API_TOKEN | ❌ No |
  | CONTAINER_TOKEN | ❌ No |
  | FIRST_PARTY_OAUTH | ❌ No |
  | THIRD_PARTY_OAUTH | ❌ No |
  | UNAUTHENTICATED | ✅ Yes |
  """
  priority: String
  """
  
  
  |Authentication Category    |Callable      |
  |:--------------------------|:-------------|
  | SESSION | ✅ Yes |
  | API_TOKEN | ❌ No |
  | CONTAINER_TOKEN | ❌ No |
  | FIRST_PARTY_OAUTH | ❌ No |
  | THIRD_PARTY_OAUTH | ❌ No |
  | UNAUTHENTICATED | ✅ Yes |
  """
  status: String
  """
  Alert summary or title.
  
  |Authentication Category    |Callable      |
  |:--------------------------|:-------------|
  | SESSION | ✅ Yes |
  | API_TOKEN | ❌ No |
  | CONTAINER_TOKEN | ❌ No |
  | FIRST_PARTY_OAUTH | ❌ No |
  | THIRD_PARTY_OAUTH | ❌ No |
  | UNAUTHENTICATED | ✅ Yes |
  """
  summary: String
  """
  When the alert was created.
  
  |Authentication Category    |Callable      |
  |:--------------------------|:-------------|
  | SESSION | ✅ Yes |
  | API_TOKEN | ❌ No |
  | CONTAINER_TOKEN | ❌ No |
  | FIRST_PARTY_OAUTH | ❌ No |
