  """
  Sanitized processing errors. Admission rejections can have an empty errors list; inspect outcome.
  
  |Authentication Category    |Callable      |
  |:--------------------------|:-------------|
  | SESSION | ✅ Yes |
  | API_TOKEN | ✅ Yes |
  | CONTAINER_TOKEN | ❌ No |
