  | THIRD_PARTY_OAUTH | ❌ No |
  | UNAUTHENTICATED | ✅ Yes |
  """
  outcome: ConfluenceContentMetricsExportStartOutcome!
  """
  Optional minimum retry delay in whole seconds, rounded up. May be provided for ACTIVE_EXPORT_CONFLICT, RATE_LIMITED, TENANT_CAPACITY_REACHED or TASK_SUBMISSION_REJECTED; null for other outcomes. Retry the same clientRequestId with unchanged input.
  
  |Authentication Category    |Callable      |
  |:--------------------------|:-------------|
  | SESSION | ✅ Yes |
  | API_TOKEN | ✅ Yes |
  | CONTAINER_TOKEN | ❌ No |
  | FIRST_PARTY_OAUTH | ✅ Yes |
  | THIRD_PARTY_OAUTH | ❌ No |
  | UNAUTHENTICATED | ✅ Yes |
