  "The recommendation origin that produced this link (e.g., XP_SEARCH, TWG_CREATE_OR_UPDATE, TWG_REMOTE_LINKS, USER_ACTIVITY_SIGNALS)."
  productSource: String
  "Source product name for both 1P and 3P links (e.g., \"Confluence\", \"Loom\", \"Google Drive\", \"SharePoint\")."
  sourceProductName: String
  """
  Name of the third party connected product. Not Applicable for 1P.
  
  
  This field is **deprecated** and will be removed in the future
  """
