"DEPRECATED — use `CsmAiAgentToolMapping`. A single tool selected on a CSM agent. Retained for FE compatibility during migration; served only by the deprecated `csmAi_updateAgentTools` and `CsmAiAgentVersion.tools`, both of which are placeholders."
