  timeOfDay: String!
}

type DevAiAutodevNextScanSchedules {
  nextScanAt: DateTime
  slots: [DevAiAutodevNextScanScheduleSlot!]!
  timezone: String!
}

"""
Lean payload for `devai_autodevNextSendWorkstreamNudges`.

In a future revision the dispatch is expected to be enqueued (rather than processed
synchronously); the response intentionally does not return per-recipient counts so the
contract survives that change. Success without errors means request was accepted.
Detailed per-dispatch metrics are emitted as structured logs and are queryable in Splunk
by `workstreamId`, `triggeredBy`, etc.
