  """
  Instant-query total for API request counts per group. Use with
  groupBy: [CONTEXT_ARI] and status filter (_5XX / _4XX) plus limit
  to rank sites by error count, then pass the resulting contextAris
  to apiRequestCountDrilldown for the per-status breakdown.
